J575d generation-aware ATCPHY backport against Linux
602042bf29f6efde39cfb5fdd9289bf4854bc0c5.

Carries the complete initial USB2/USB3 M3 implementation from primary
24065f2feb4d9cd6ac1e2f4c8c229d1370073d9d. The binding additionally admits
the intentional ordered t6031,t8122 fallback in the candidate board DT at
77cb8f24c2381a8abb7272d7bbdec548d6426a8a; no bare T6031 match is added.
DisplayPort functionality is not established or required for this stage.

Application: patch --batch --fuzz=0 -p0 from the pinned source root.
No physical initialization or native qualification is claimed.

